===Etymology===
A [[portmanteau word]], coined by [[w:Sigurður Nordal|Sigurður Nordal]] in 1965 from {{blend|is|tala|t1=number|völva|t2=prophetess|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtʰœlva/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|œlva|lang=is}}

